   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Intro/warmup**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Squelch The Weasel**: back after 68 archived shows (852 days) [4]\n- **Sweet Texas Fire**: back after 61 archived shows (811 days) [4]\n- **Drifter In The Dark**: back after 145 archived shows (1701 days) [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2005-12-01.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 32 songs; 155 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **Ween2005-12-01**: source not stated; 32 songs; 153 min [2]. Said about its sound: The taper moved to an OTS position left of the board between songs, and the move is not audible in the recording [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The taper's rig was first set up down front; after the HIV song he was caught and told to move back [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2005-12-01.flac16**: taped by Mike B; transferred by Mike B; source: Oktava MC012 > Edirol UA5 > RCA Out > JB3 (@ 16/44.1) [1]\n- **Ween2005-12-01**: Recorded with MBHO 603A capsules and KA200N, going through Segue Dogstar Silver XLR cables, Grace V3 with optical mod, JB3, then PC, CDR, EAC, FLAC [2]",
